Today is Thursday.
I leave the office at exactly five o'clock.
A new project has started at the office this week.
Our team has worked a lot.
I go straight to the local sports club.
Every Thursday at half past five I play badminton there.
I do not have my own racket.
Therefore, I always rent a racket at the club.
Amit and Neha have already arrived at the court.
Amit asks, "Maya, why are you so tired today?"
I say, "The job of a software engineer is not easy!"
I have worked very hard this week.
Neha smiles and says, "Then come on, let's start the match!"
We play a vigorous match.
I hit the shuttlecock very fast.
I have a lot of fun playing.
After the game, I feel very good.
My entire week's stress has vanished.
